, [64, 148437], [68, 148657], [73, 148957], [76, 149177]]}, {"verse": 22, "start": 149892, "end": 154067, "text": "But Jesus said to him, Follow me; and let the dead bury their dead.", "words": [[0, 149892], [4, 150018], [10, 150318], [15, 150758], [18, 150958], [23, 151471], [30, 151683], [34, 152316], [38, 152415], [42, 152555], [46, 152715], [51, 152975], [56, 153335], [62, 153575]]}, {"verse": 23, "start": 154347, "end": 157944, "text": "¶ And when he was entered into a ship, his disciples followed him.", "words": [[2, 154347], [6, 154479], [11, 154639], [14, 154799], [18, 154939], [26, 155259], [31, 155579], [33, 155759], [39, 156439], [43, 156579], [53, 157079], [62, 157479]]}, {"verse": 24, "start": 158294, "end": 165023, "text": "And, behold, there arose a great tempest in the sea, so that the ship was covered with the waves: but he was asleep.", "words": [[0, 158294], [5, 158431], [13, 159191], [19, 159311], [25, 159591], [27, 159751], [33, 159991], [41, 160551], [44, 160711], [48, 160831], [53, 161411], [56, 161591], [61, 161771], [65, 161931], [70, 162131], [74, 162351], [82, 162671], [87, 162931], [91, 163091], [98, 163910], [102, 164032], [105, 164172], [109, 164352]]}, {"verse": 25, "start": 165373, "end": 170592, "text": "And his disciples came to him, and awoke him, saying, Lord, save us: we perish.", "words": [[0, 165373], [4, 165499], [8, 165619], [18, 166139], [23, 166459], [26, 166699], [31, 166919], [35, 167179], [41, 167619], [46, 167779], [54, 168589], [60, 168850], [65, 169170], [69, 169814], [72, 169958]]}, {"verse": 26, "start": 170872, "end": 180455, "text": "And he says to them, Why are you fearful, O you of little faith? Then he arose, and rebuked the winds and the sea; and there was a great calm.", "words": [[0, 170872], [4, 170995], [7, 171115], [12, 171335], [15, 171555], [21, 172114], [25, 172392], [29, 172632], [33, 172772], [42, 173672], [44, 173932], [48, 174172], [51, 174372], [58, 174592], [63, 176181], [65, 177172], [70, 177184], [73, 177207], [80, 177230], [84, 177254], [92, 177277], [96, 177377], [102, 177717], [106, 177977], [110, 178097], [115, 178888], [119, 179014], [125, 179114], [129, 179274], [131, 179374], [137, 179634]]}, {"verse": 27, "start": 180805, "end": 186536, "text": "But the men marvelled, saying, What manner of man is this, that even the winds and the sea obey him!", "words": [[0, 180805], [4, 180907], [8, 181047], [12, 181517], [23, 181987], [31, 182719], [36, 182880], [43, 183200], [46, 183380], [50, 183600], [53, 183780], [59, 184060], [64, 184500], [69, 184800], [73, 185000], [79, 185260], [83, 185460], [87, 185580], [91, 185860], [96, 186120]]}, {"verse": 28, "start": 186816, "end": 197659, "text": "¶ And when he was come to the other side into the country of the Gergesenes, there met him two demon-possessed, coming out of the tombs, exceeding fierce, so that no man might pass by that way.", "words": [[2, 186816], [6, 186947], [11, 187087], [14, 187227], [18, 187387], [23, 187607], [26, 187747], [30, 187867], [36, 187987], [41, 188427], [46, 188667], [50, 188827], [58, 189167], [61, 189347], [65, 189947], [77, 190547], [83, 190687], [87, 190947], [91, 191087], [95, 191897], [112, 192707], [119, 192887], [123, 193127], [126, 193227], [130, 193327], [137, 194047], [147, 194407], [155, 195211], [158, 195371], [163, 195551], [166, 195831], [170, 196191], [176, 196431], [181, 196731], [184, 197011], [189, 197231]]}, {"verse": 29, "start": 198009, "end": 205749, "text": "And, behold, they cried out, saying, What have we to do with you, Jesus, you Son of God? are you come here to torment us before the time?", "words": [[0, 198009], [5, 198147], [13, 198887], [18, 199087], [24, 199387], [29, 199827], [37, 200510], [42, 200619], [47, 200729], [50, 200849], [53, 200989], [56, 201149], [61, 201329], [66, 201689], [73, 202129], [77, 202189], [81, 202409], [84, 202549], [89, 203149], [93, 203280], [97, 203420], [102, 203660], [107, 203980], [110, 204140], [118, 204520], [121, 204860], [128, 205120], [132, 205340]]}, {"verse": 30, "start": 206029, "end": 209438, "text": "And there was a good way off from them a herd of many swine feeding.", "words": [[0, 206029], [4, 206170], [10, 206270], [14, 206430], [16, 206530], [21, 206710], [25, 206930], [29, 207170], [34, 207410], [39, 207670], [41, 207770], [46, 208030], [49, 208190], [54, 208430], [60, 208890]]}, {"verse": 31, "start": 209788, "end": 215722, "text": "So the demons besought him, saying, If you cast us out, permit us to go away into the herd of swine.", "words": [[0, 209788], [3, 209933], [7, 210093], [14, 210393], [23, 210913], [28, 211113], [36, 211921], [39, 212056], [43, 212136], [48, 212436], [51, 212636], [56, 213216], [63, 213556], [66, 213796], [69, 213916], [72, 214096], [77, 214396], [82, 214696], [86, 214856], [91, 215116], [94, 215236]]}, {"verse": 32, "start": 216002, "end": 228733, "text": "And he said to them, Go. And when they were come out, they went into the herd of swine: and, behold, the whole herd of swine ran violently down a steep place into the sea, and perished in the waters.", "words": [[0, 216002], [4, 216133], [7, 216253], [12, 216493], [15, 216693], [21, 217238], [25, 217920], [29, 218048], [34, 218208], [39, 218368], [44, 218528], [49, 218768], [54, 219428], [59, 219628], [64, 219868], [69, 220128], [73, 220288], [78, 220548], [81, 220708], [88, 221657], [93, 221840], [101, 222880], [105, 222940], [111, 223240], [116, 223560], [119, 223700], [125, 224260], [129, 224500], [139, 225080], [144, 225400], [146, 225580], [152, 225840], [158, 226240], [163, 226560], [167, 226740], [172, 227080], [176, 227355], [185, 227855], [188, 227995], [192, 228095]]}, {"verse": 33, "start": 229083, "end": 237047, "text": "And they that kept them fled, and went their ways into the city, and told every thing, and what was befallen to the possessed of the demons.", "words": [[0, 229083], [4, 229223], [9, 229403], [14, 229643], [19, 229943], [24, 230163], [30, 230523], [34